|o3 : List                                                    |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : K_1                                                     |
|                                                             |
|o4 = {{1, 2}, {1, 3}, {2, 3}}                                |
|                                                             |
|o4 : List                                                    |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : K_0                                                     |
|                                                             |
|o5 = {{1}, {2}, {3}}                                         |
|                                                             |
|o5 : List                                                    |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : K_(-1)                                                  |
