|                                                    |
|o1 : AbstractSimplicialComplex                      |
+----------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : J = ambientAbstractSimplicialComplexSize(K)    |
|                                                    |
|o2 = 3                                              |
+----------------------------------------------------+

