Calculations with random simplicial complexes -- homological calculations on random simplicial complexes
********************************************************************************************************

In what follows we illustrate a collection of homological calculations that can
be performed on random simplicial complexes.

Create a random abstract simplicial complex with vertices supported on a subset
of $[n] = \{1,...,n\}$.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : K = randomAbstractSimplicialComplex(4)                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = AbstractSimplicialComplex{-1 => {{}}                                    |
|                               0 => {{1}, {2}, {3}, {4}}                     |
